/* =====================================================================
   311-v100anim — v1.0 ANIMATED GLADIATOR TOKENS IN MATCHES (his 3D answers 2026-10-11 + SPEED × ANIMATION a + ANIM MEMORY;
   look test tools/plans/look100/NOTES-look-anim.md). DISPLAY ONLY: rules, dice, RNG, S, the log and the online hash are untouched.
   • STAND-INS: the 8 PRINTED classes wear rig92 3D stand-ins (the production token + the gear100 bake + each class's real kit), rendered
     ONCE at build time by tools/art/anim100/make.js at the drawn size (ANIM100_META pxmm 2.6), 8 facings (MINI_YAW, no mirroring: the
     shield stays in its hand), as TWO sheets per class: assets/anim100_<cls>_move.webp (idle breathing/weight shift + walk — loaded when
     the class first shows) and assets/anim100_<cls>_act.webp (attack, block, hit/recoil, injured limp, scared, push, topple a pillar,
     knock a pot, fall/die, severed forearm — downloaded after the move sheet, each ACTION decoded into its own ImageBitmap only when
     first needed). Worn whenever the token style draws minis (standee) or figures (the default); the token's base, size and seat rim
     follow 222/276 (base = MINI_BASE of a tile). The standalone download carries no sheets (mkshare skips anim100_*): today's tokens.
   • STUDIO + ONLINE 3D TOKENS (222 tok93 / 226 t94): their move + act sheets are rendered ON THIS DEVICE with the same pose list and
     renderer (the ANIM100_LIB block below — make.js evaluates that block, so build time and device agree), one figure at a time on idle
     callbacks, never while the Studio's modeller / converter holds the 3D engine, never HEADLESS / sims (headless browsers only with
     localStorage flavius_anim100dev=1), cached in IndexedDB 'flavius_anim100' keyed by look + gear + pose set + scale (≤ AN100.dbMax
     figures). Until ready (or when WebGL is off) they draw today's still cell + the glide. Online: per viewer, nothing is sent.
   • POSES step every AN100.poseMs (120 ms); the POSITION GLIDES between tiles every frame (a screen-space offset in a drawPlayer wrapper,
     like 294's push; ROT89 / zoom / camera follow). Started by LISTENING: BUS 'hit' (hit / block when armour took it all / sever when the
     right arm falls + a short flash), 'elim' (the fall row plays where he fell, he lies a moment and fades — drawn after the pieces layer),
     and light wrappers on doAttack (attack), doTopple (topple), breakPot (knock), doPush (no second glide) + 294's push100Pose hook (push
     row by the shove's progress; the flat lean tilt is skipped for a stand-in). Walking with a leg at ≤2 HP = limp; a wild beast hunting
     him within 2 tiles = scared.
   • SEVERED SETS (his 5a): one lost limb (rarm/larm/rleg/lleg, hp 0) → that limb's own sheets assets/anim100_<cls>_<limb>_move|act.webp
     (meta ANIM100_META[cls].sev[limb]; `node tools/art/anim100/make.js sev`, then sevenc.py; ~100 KB a set, 3.3 MB for 32): the bone scaled
     away + a wound cap, its gear and the weapon / shield of that hand gone; MOVE idle + walk (a lost leg = a hobble on the other), ACT
     attack, hit, fall (other actions borrow AN100L.SEV_MAP). Requested only when the limb falls; the sever pose plays on the whole body
     first (`sevT`; right arm = its sever row, else the hit row), then the swap. Two or more lost limbs = today's token.
   • GEAR-TRUE (his pick c): at the event's first turn each gladiator's loadout is noted ONCE (AN100.gear: pieces + weapons in hand;
     later changes ignored). A printed class in exactly its kit keeps the prebuilt sheets; any other loadout (Manager owned gear, drafts,
     online kits, Studio classes) is rendered ON THIS DEVICE keyed by look + loadout (+ limb), the stand-in / today's token meanwhile.
     Queue: every MOVE sheet first (yours first), then ACT sheets; an act render gives way to a waiting move (a fresh severed set).
   • SPEED (his pick a): Slow / Normal = full animation; FAST = CPU tokens (and other online seats) on their still cell + glide + hit
     flash, YOUR OWN gladiator still animates; To the end (snap) / sims = nothing extra; Animations Off / Reduce motion / calm = the still
     cell always (no flash, no glide); hidden tab = no loop; idle92 = no idle breathing.
   • COST: one drawImage of an already decoded cell per piece; the clock (an100Tick) runs only while something animates — a rAF frame per
     glide/action frame, else a timer to the next pose change (idle breath ~2.6 draws/s, none in idle92). AN100.stats counts draws.
   Kill switch localStorage flavius_anim100off=1 → exactly today's drawing (no wrapper does anything). Test tv100an; shots tools/plans/anim100/.
   • v1.01 (workstream E, his notes): G6 no idle motion (idle = one still frame, no breathing / cower / limp loops; those rows are gone from the
     act sheet) · G10 attack rows slash / sweep / thrust / throw picked by weapon (an100AtkRow, Math.random for blades) + a slash arc on the
     board (an100Slash / an100DrawVfx) · G12 an 8-frame cautious walk stepped by the glide. Test tv101f.
   ===================================================================== */
